00:07:17.239 --> 00:07:22.239
and just all of the communities who live in fear,

00:07:22.339 --> 00:07:25.239
who are harboring hate instead of love,

00:07:25.339 --> 00:07:27.239
and just the ways that we deeply need

00:07:27.339 --> 00:07:31.239
