00:07:51.339 --> 00:07:53.239
and helped, and the people who are severely

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:55.239
traumatized by that event.

00:07:55.339 --> 00:07:59.239
So if you will, bow your heads with me.

00:07:59.339 --> 00:08:04.239
