00:08:14.239 --> 00:08:17.239
Christ, you wept over this city.

00:08:17.339 --> 00:08:20.239
We are in deepest despair as we weep over the dead

00:08:20.339 --> 00:08:22.239
and injured, killed by guns.

00:08:22.339 --> 00:08:25.239
In anguish, we recognize the bloodstains of hatred.

00:08:25.339 --> 00:08:28.239
We hear the sounds of fear, the echoes of gunshot,

00:08:28.339 --> 00:08:31.239
