00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.239
How can we end this nightmare of violence?

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:43.239
How can we build a world of inclusion, of solidarity?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:47.239
Give us the grace to reflect deeply and to work ceaselessly

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.239
