00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.239
May they find healing.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.239
We pray for our nation.

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:06.239
May we end the hate.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.239
