Sit quietly before God.

00:44:30.340 --> 00:44:32.239
It's not really my jam.

00:44:32.340 --> 00:44:34.239
And just to name it,

00:44:34.340 --> 00:44:36.239
I'm not saying that's like,

00:44:36.340 --> 00:44:37.239
surprising.

00:44:37.340 --> 00:44:38.239
Like, yeah, no, no kidding.

