we're kind of all a flurry

00:44:46.239 --> 00:44:48.139
even in our religious activity.

00:44:48.239 --> 00:44:50.139
And this whole prayer silence,

00:44:50.239 --> 00:44:53.139
this can be very challenging.

00:44:53.239 --> 00:44:55.139
One way I often think of like,

00:44:55.239 --> 00:44:57.139
what's a good way to indicate

00:44:57.239 --> 00:44:59.139
or know what kind of mental mode

00:44:59.239 --> 00:45:00.139
you're in?

00:45:00.239 --> 00:45:01.139
And for me,

00:45:01.239 --> 00:45:02.139
this might be helpful for you.

00:45:02.239 --> 00:45:04.139
One thing I ask myself is,

00:45:04.239 --> 00:45:05.139
and this isn't when you're praying.

00:45:05.239 --> 00:45:06.139
This is like outside

00:45:06.239 --> 00:45:07.139
of a time of prayer.

00:45:07.239 --> 00:45:12.139
Right now, could I do a boring thing

00:45:12.239 --> 00:45:13.139
by boring, I mean,

00:45:13.239 --> 00:45:16.139
something super simple.

00:45:16.239 --> 00:45:18.139
Could I do that without

00:45:18.239 --> 00:45:21.139
another distraction at the same time?

00:45:21.239 --> 00:45:22.139
It's like, for example,

00:45:22.239 --> 00:45:24.139
I can tell what mental mode I'm in,

00:45:24.239 --> 00:45:26.139
the quality of my presence,

00:45:26.239 --> 00:45:28.139
if I have to, for example,

00:45:28.239 --> 00:45:30.139
like do the dishes.

00:45:30.239 --> 00:45:33.139
And do I, when I do the dishes,

00:45:33.239 --> 00:45:35.139
sometimes I'm in like a good

00:45:35.239 --> 00:45:36.139
head space, heart space,

00:45:36.239 --> 00:45:38.139
and I can just like do the dishes.

00:45:38.239 --> 00:45:40.139
But then other times,

00:45:40.139 --> 00:45:43.040
I like need something else.

00:45:43.139 --> 00:45:44.040
Do you know what I'm talking about?

00:45:44.139 --> 00:45:45.040
Like where you need,

00:45:45.139 --> 00:45:47.040
like someone please turn on

00:45:47.139 --> 00:45:50.040
the television or the radio

00:45:50.139 --> 00:45:51.040
or the, you know what I mean,

00:45:51.139 --> 00:45:52.040
like some sort of music

00:45:52.139 --> 00:45:53.040
or a podcast or a something.

00:45:53.139 --> 00:45:54.040
And of course,

00:45:54.139 --> 00:45:55.040
there's times I'm not saying,

00:45:55.139 --> 00:45:56.040
like if you were listening

00:45:56.139 --> 00:45:57.040
to a podcast while you do the dishes,

00:45:57.139 --> 00:45:58.040
that's a sin.

00:45:58.139 --> 00:45:59.040
That's not my point.

00:45:59.139 --> 00:46:01.040
I'm saying, you know,

00:46:01.139 --> 00:46:03.040
if all of a sudden you found,

00:46:03.139 --> 00:46:05.040
like your phone went dead,

00:46:05.139 --> 00:46:06.040
if you would panic,

00:46:06.139 --> 00:46:08.040
that's usually a sign

00:46:08.139 --> 00:46:10.040
you're not in a super good place.

00:46:10.139 --> 00:46:11.040
Does that make sense?

00:46:11.139 --> 00:46:12.040
Because it's all,

00:46:12.139 --> 00:46:13.040
it's similar with driving

00:46:13.139 --> 00:46:14.040
is another great one.

00:46:14.139 --> 00:46:15.040
Like when we're driving,

00:46:15.139 --> 00:46:17.040
do we have to have that noise?

00:46:17.139 --> 00:46:19.040
Like oh, turn it on.

00:46:19.139 --> 00:46:20.040
Can't do this.

00:46:20.139 --> 00:46:21.040
And why do we need the noise?

00:46:21.139 --> 00:46:23.040
Why do I need the noise?

00:46:23.139 --> 00:46:27.040
It's usually because there's feelings.

00:46:27.139 --> 00:46:28.040
Feelings inside of me.

00:46:28.139 --> 00:46:29.040
Do you have feelings?

00:46:29.139 --> 00:46:31.040
I have feelings.

00:46:31.139 --> 00:46:32.040
Right?

00:46:32.139 --> 00:46:33.040
We start, and all of a sudden

00:46:33.139 --> 00:46:34.040
when we come to a place

00:46:34.139 --> 00:46:37.040
of prayer and silence,

00:46:37.040 --> 00:46:39.939
that stuff tends to come up.

00:46:40.040 --> 00:46:40.939
And it can be really,

00:46:41.040 --> 00:46:41.939
really challenging.

00:46:42.040 --> 00:46:44.939
There was a season in my life,

00:46:45.040 --> 00:46:45.939
it was actually when we were

00:46:46.040 --> 00:46:46.939
going through the process

00:46:47.040 --> 00:46:47.939
of starting the table

00:46:48.040 --> 00:46:48.939
and we were leaving

00:46:49.040 --> 00:46:50.939
our previous church community.

00:46:51.040 --> 00:46:51.939
And we were leaving,

00:46:52.040 --> 00:46:54.939
I mean 20, 15, 20, 25 year

00:46:55.040 --> 00:46:56.939
like relationships there.

00:46:57.040 --> 00:46:58.939
Deep friendships.

00:46:59.040 --> 00:46:59.939
Wonderful people.

00:47:00.040 --> 00:47:01.939
But we did have reasons

00:47:02.040 --> 00:47:02.939
for our leaving.

00:47:03.040 --> 00:47:04.939
And there was theological struggles

00:47:05.040 --> 00:47:05.939
and conversations.

00:47:05.939 --> 00:47:07.840
Very emotionally tumultuous.

00:47:07.939 --> 00:47:10.840
And it was probably

00:47:10.939 --> 00:47:13.840
that because I'd spent some time

00:47:13.939 --> 00:47:14.840
in doing some of these

00:47:14.939 --> 00:47:15.840
spiritual practices and things

00:47:15.939 --> 00:47:16.840
that I noticed,

00:47:16.939 --> 00:47:17.840
I wish I could say,

00:47:17.939 --> 00:47:19.840
and boy, I have never prayed more

00:47:19.939 --> 00:47:21.840
than in that season.

00:47:21.939 --> 00:47:22.840
But I can't really say that.

00:47:22.939 --> 00:47:23.840
Instead what I noticed

00:47:23.939 --> 00:47:25.840
is that I had never,

00:47:25.939 --> 00:47:26.840
it was about a six month window,

00:47:26.939 --> 00:47:28.840
I had never listened to more

00:47:28.939 --> 00:47:31.840
sports talk radio and podcasts

00:47:31.939 --> 00:47:33.840
than in that season of my life.

00:47:33.939 --> 00:47:34.840
And why?

00:47:34.840 --> 00:47:37.739
It was because I was in pain.

00:47:37.840 --> 00:47:39.739
And so I didn't,

00:47:39.840 --> 00:47:40.739
like to drive,

00:47:40.840 --> 00:47:43.739
I couldn't just drive.

00:47:43.840 --> 00:47:44.739
Uh-uh.

00:47:44.840 --> 00:47:45.739
Needed the thing.

00:47:45.840 --> 00:47:46.739
You know what I mean?

00:47:46.840 --> 00:47:47.739
Couldn't just fold the laundry

00:47:47.840 --> 00:47:48.739
or do the dishes

00:47:48.840 --> 00:47:49.739
or whatever it was.

00:47:49.840 --> 00:47:52.739
Like no, I needed the noise

00:47:52.840 --> 00:47:54.739
in that season, right?

00:47:54.840 --> 00:47:55.739
I was coping.

00:47:55.840 --> 00:47:57.739
And again, just to be clear,

00:47:57.840 --> 00:47:58.739
I'm not trying to judge it, right?

00:47:58.840 --> 00:47:59.739
But it was good for me

00:47:59.840 --> 00:48:01.739
to be aware

00:48:01.840 --> 00:48:02.739
and to realize like,

00:48:02.840 --> 00:48:03.739
ooh, this is gonna be a season

00:48:03.739 --> 00:48:05.639
where prayer is gonna be challenging.

00:48:05.739 --> 00:48:06.639
For some of you,

00:48:06.739 --> 00:48:07.639
you might be in a season

00:48:07.739 --> 00:48:10.639
where prayer is really challenging

00:48:10.739 --> 00:48:13.639
because there's a lot going on

00:48:13.739 --> 00:48:16.639
in here, right?

00:48:16.739 --> 00:48:18.639
The head, the heart.

00:48:18.739 --> 00:48:19.639
And what I would encourage you to do

00:48:19.739 --> 00:48:21.639
is be gentle with yourself,

00:48:21.739 --> 00:48:23.639
but at the same time,

00:48:23.739 --> 00:48:25.639
press in.

00:48:25.739 --> 00:48:27.639
Because it's often precisely

00:48:27.739 --> 00:48:31.639
the things we need to work through, right?

00:48:31.739 --> 00:48:33.639
All the things we're avoiding,

00:48:33.739 --> 00:48:34.639
are often the things

00:48:34.739 --> 00:48:36.639
like we need to work through.

00:48:36.739 --> 00:48:38.639
In other words, to pray well,

00:48:38.739 --> 00:48:40.639
I need to calm down

00:48:40.739 --> 00:48:42.639
and slow down.

00:48:42.739 --> 00:48:45.639
I must embrace stillness

00:48:45.739 --> 00:48:47.639
and silence.

00:48:47.739 --> 00:48:48.639
That leads to our third insight.

00:48:48.739 --> 00:48:50.639
Pray as you can,

00:48:50.739 --> 00:48:52.639
not as you can't.

00:48:52.739 --> 00:48:54.639
That is right from Coakley,

00:48:54.739 --> 00:48:55.639
there at the end of her quote,

00:48:55.739 --> 00:48:56.639
of which I love this.

00:48:56.739 --> 00:48:57.639
Pray as you can,

00:48:57.739 --> 00:48:58.639
not as you can't.

00:48:58.739 --> 00:49:00.639
You know, there may be a season

00:49:00.739 --> 00:49:02.639
where you need the anchor

00:49:02.639 --> 00:49:04.540
of words.

00:49:04.639 --> 00:49:06.540
Matthew 6.

00:49:06.639 --> 00:49:07.540
Like maybe even literally

00:49:07.639 --> 00:49:08.540
the Lord's Prayer.

00:49:08.639 --> 00:49:10.540
Like you pray that prayer

00:49:10.639 --> 00:49:12.540
or some version of it

00:49:12.639 --> 00:49:13.540
every day.

00:49:13.639 --> 00:49:15.540
In fact, I think it's a good grounding practice

00:49:15.639 --> 00:49:17.540
for Christians to really never leave

00:49:17.639 --> 00:49:18.540
behind that prayer.

00:49:18.639 --> 00:49:20.540
I think it's a very grounding,

00:49:20.639 --> 00:49:21.540
orienting prayer.

00:49:21.639 --> 00:49:22.540
But there may be a particular season

00:49:22.639 --> 00:49:25.540
where the idea of just stillness, silence,

00:49:25.639 --> 00:49:26.540
you're just like,

00:49:26.639 --> 00:49:29.540
not my thing.

00:49:29.639 --> 00:49:30.540
And that's okay.

00:49:30.639 --> 00:49:31.540
But there may be a time

00:49:31.540 --> 00:49:33.439
where you need Matthew 6.

00:49:33.540 --> 00:49:35.439
You need the Psalms.

00:49:35.540 --> 00:49:37.439
You need maybe other prayer books

00:49:37.540 --> 00:49:38.439
that people have written

00:49:38.540 --> 00:49:39.439
down through the centuries

00:49:39.540 --> 00:49:41.439
where like you need to be given

00:49:41.540 --> 00:49:43.439
the words to pray.

00:49:43.540 --> 00:49:44.439
And like to that I say,

00:49:44.540 --> 00:49:45.439
yes and amen.

00:49:45.540 --> 00:49:47.439
Go for it.

00:49:47.540 --> 00:49:49.439
And vice versa.

00:49:49.540 --> 00:49:51.439
There may be seasons

00:49:51.540 --> 00:49:53.439
where all of those words

00:49:53.540 --> 00:49:57.439
either A, just don't resonate with you

00:49:57.540 --> 00:49:58.439
in that time.

00:49:58.540 --> 00:50:00.439
Don't connect with you.

00:50:00.439 --> 00:50:02.340
Maybe you're even in a season

00:50:02.439 --> 00:50:03.340
of deconstruction.

00:50:03.439 --> 00:50:04.340
This is sort of what happened to me

00:50:04.439 --> 00:50:06.340
and how I learned about silence.

00:50:06.439 --> 00:50:07.340
I was in a season

00:50:07.439 --> 00:50:09.340
where I was radically changing

00:50:09.439 --> 00:50:11.340
so much theologically

00:50:11.439 --> 00:50:13.340
that a lot of the language

00:50:13.439 --> 00:50:14.340
of scripture and prayer

00:50:14.439 --> 00:50:17.340
was really rubbing me the wrong way.

00:50:17.439 --> 00:50:20.340
I was really struggling with it.

00:50:20.439 --> 00:50:21.340
There were times where

00:50:21.439 --> 00:50:23.340
I wasn't even sure if God was there.

00:50:23.439 --> 00:50:26.340
So to try to pray the Psalms

00:50:26.439 --> 00:50:27.340
or something I was like,

00:50:27.439 --> 00:50:28.340
oh my gosh, I can't.

00:50:28.439 --> 00:50:29.340
I just can't do it.

00:50:29.340 --> 00:50:31.239
But in that season,

00:50:31.340 --> 00:50:32.239
instead of just giving up

00:50:32.340 --> 00:50:33.239
on God or prayer or whatever,

00:50:33.340 --> 00:50:36.239
instead it was silence.

00:50:36.340 --> 00:50:37.239
I would just close that door

00:50:37.340 --> 00:50:39.239
and just sit quietly

00:50:39.340 --> 00:50:42.239
and do nothing.

00:50:42.340 --> 00:50:43.239
And then over time,

00:50:43.340 --> 00:50:44.239
what happened?

00:50:44.340 --> 00:50:45.239
Like I said earlier,

00:50:45.340 --> 00:50:47.239
after like a year,

00:50:47.340 --> 00:50:50.239
suddenly the words started

00:50:50.340 --> 00:50:52.239
coming back to me again.

00:50:52.340 --> 00:50:54.239
And now I kind of interweave them.

00:50:54.340 --> 00:50:55.239
In other words,

00:50:55.340 --> 00:50:58.239
just pray as you can.

00:50:58.239 --> 00:51:00.139
Not as you can't.

00:51:00.239 --> 00:51:01.139
If all you have

00:51:01.239 --> 00:51:03.139
is five minutes of silence,

00:51:03.239 --> 00:51:04.139
do it.

00:51:04.239 --> 00:51:06.139
Go for it.

00:51:06.239 --> 00:51:07.139
If all you have

00:51:07.239 --> 00:51:08.139
is the Lord's prayer

00:51:08.239 --> 00:51:10.139
in the morning and the evening,

00:51:10.239 --> 00:51:12.139
wonderful.

00:51:12.239 --> 00:51:13.139
I think we often get hung up

00:51:13.239 --> 00:51:15.139
on the amount of time too.

00:51:15.239 --> 00:51:16.139
If I was really holy,

00:51:16.239 --> 00:51:17.139
I'd pray for an hour a day,

00:51:17.239 --> 00:51:18.139
but I can't pray for an hour a day,

00:51:18.239 --> 00:51:20.139
so I'm not going to pray at all.

00:51:20.239 --> 00:51:22.139
We kind of set these weird standards

00:51:22.239 --> 00:51:24.139
and bars and hoops to jump through.

00:51:24.239 --> 00:51:27.139
Pray as you can.

00:51:27.139 --> 00:51:30.040
Not as you can't.

00:51:30.139 --> 00:51:32.040
So let's shift here

00:51:32.139 --> 00:51:33.040
towards the end.

00:51:33.139 --> 00:51:34.040
I want to wrap up with

00:51:34.139 --> 00:51:36.040
how to pray.

00:51:36.139 --> 00:51:38.040
Like maybe A,

00:51:38.139 --> 00:51:39.040
maybe you've prayed for a while,

00:51:39.139 --> 00:51:41.040
but you could use some freshness

00:51:41.139 --> 00:51:43.040
in that routine.

00:51:43.139 --> 00:51:44.040
Or B, maybe you're like,

00:51:44.139 --> 00:51:46.040
I don't really do the prayer thing.

00:51:46.139 --> 00:51:48.040
Maybe this could help you

00:51:48.139 --> 00:51:50.040
kind of be an on-ramp.

00:51:50.139 --> 00:51:53.040
So I'm going to give you six steps,

00:51:53.139 --> 00:51:54.040
so they will go quick.

00:51:54.139 --> 00:51:55.040
Don't worry.

00:51:55.139 --> 00:51:57.040
Not 10 minutes on each.

00:51:57.139 --> 00:51:58.040
Just a few minutes.

00:51:58.139 --> 00:51:59.040
So step one,

00:51:59.139 --> 00:52:01.040
wear your PJs

00:52:01.139 --> 00:52:03.040
or other comfy clothing

00:52:03.139 --> 00:52:06.040
and find a quietish place.

00:52:06.139 --> 00:52:07.040
I realize this can sound

00:52:07.139 --> 00:52:08.040
a little bit silly,

00:52:08.139 --> 00:52:09.040
but really what I'm trying to get at

00:52:09.139 --> 00:52:13.040
is do your best

00:52:13.139 --> 00:52:17.040
to make prayer enjoyable.

00:52:17.139 --> 00:52:19.040
Instead of,

00:52:19.139 --> 00:52:20.040
I don't know,

00:52:20.139 --> 00:52:21.040
it can get, I think at times,

00:52:21.139 --> 00:52:25.040
overly formal or something.

00:52:25.139 --> 00:52:26.040
You know what I mean?

00:52:26.139 --> 00:52:27.040
Where it's sort of like,

00:52:27.139 --> 00:52:28.040
there is something beautiful

00:52:28.139 --> 00:52:30.040
about reverence,

00:52:30.139 --> 00:52:31.040
but that I think is much more

00:52:31.139 --> 00:52:33.040
about a heart posture before God

00:52:33.139 --> 00:52:35.040
than making sure

00:52:35.139 --> 00:52:37.040
you put on your Sunday best,

00:52:37.139 --> 00:52:39.040
whatever that would mean at the table.

00:52:39.139 --> 00:52:40.040
I'm not sure.

00:52:40.139 --> 00:52:41.040
We don't really do,

00:52:41.139 --> 00:52:42.040
we're not really a Sunday best

00:52:42.139 --> 00:52:43.040
kind of place, you know.

00:52:43.139 --> 00:52:44.040
But you know what I'm saying.

00:52:44.139 --> 00:52:45.040
Like when we come to prayer,

00:52:45.139 --> 00:52:49.040
like just be yourself.

00:52:49.139 --> 00:52:51.040
Just show up simply as yourself,

00:52:51.139 --> 00:52:52.040
just you and God.

00:52:52.139 --> 00:52:53.040
Make the time enjoyable.

00:52:53.139 --> 00:52:55.040
All right, step two,

00:52:55.139 --> 00:52:56.040
sit, stand, kneel,

00:52:56.040 --> 00:52:57.939
or lay comfortably.

00:52:58.040 --> 00:52:58.939
You'll learn over time

00:52:59.040 --> 00:53:01.939
what's best for you.

00:53:02.040 --> 00:53:02.939
This might sound like I'm saying

00:53:03.040 --> 00:53:04.939
posture doesn't matter.

00:53:05.040 --> 00:53:05.939
That's not what I'm saying.

00:53:06.040 --> 00:53:07.939
Actually, I do think people,

00:53:08.040 --> 00:53:08.939
maybe especially in the kind of

00:53:09.040 --> 00:53:09.939
Protestant evangelical world

00:53:10.040 --> 00:53:10.939
that I came from,

00:53:11.040 --> 00:53:11.939
it's sort of like, oh, you know,

00:53:12.040 --> 00:53:12.939
posture doesn't care,

00:53:13.040 --> 00:53:13.939
God doesn't care,

00:53:14.040 --> 00:53:14.939
it doesn't matter.

00:53:15.040 --> 00:53:15.939
Just do whatever.

00:53:16.040 --> 00:53:17.939
And I agree and disagree.

00:53:18.040 --> 00:53:18.939
I agree in the sense

00:53:19.040 --> 00:53:19.939
that I don't think God's judging.

00:53:20.040 --> 00:53:22.939
Like, oh, thou shalt kneel before me.

00:53:23.040 --> 00:53:24.939
I don't think God's fine.

00:53:24.939 --> 00:53:25.840
But here's what posture does,

00:53:25.939 --> 00:53:27.840
is it does, it influences the body

00:53:27.939 --> 00:53:29.840
which influences the mind.

00:53:29.939 --> 00:53:30.840
And so, for example,

00:53:30.939 --> 00:53:32.840
depending even on what type of

00:53:32.939 --> 00:53:34.840
praying you're doing,

00:53:34.939 --> 00:53:36.840
I think adjusting your posture

00:53:36.939 --> 00:53:38.840
can be really powerful.

00:53:38.939 --> 00:53:39.840
So, for example,

00:53:39.939 --> 00:53:40.840
when I'm praying for others

00:53:40.939 --> 00:53:41.840
or praying the Lord's Prayer,

00:53:41.939 --> 00:53:44.840
I do enjoy kneeling.

00:53:44.939 --> 00:53:45.840
At the same time,

00:53:45.939 --> 00:53:48.840
I can't do that for an hour.

00:53:48.939 --> 00:53:49.840
I don't know if you've ever tried

00:53:49.939 --> 00:53:52.840
to like kneel for a long time,

00:53:52.939 --> 00:53:53.840
at least without pads.

00:53:53.840 --> 00:53:55.739
It can get painful, right?

00:53:55.840 --> 00:53:56.739
So maybe if you're going to

00:53:56.840 --> 00:53:58.739
sit in silence for a while,

00:53:58.840 --> 00:53:59.739
maybe it's just sitting on a chair

00:53:59.840 --> 00:54:01.739
like this with your back straight

00:54:01.840 --> 00:54:02.739
and your palms open

00:54:02.840 --> 00:54:04.739
and just something you can do

00:54:04.840 --> 00:54:05.739
for a while, right?

00:54:05.840 --> 00:54:07.739
Maybe hands raised, maybe hands up.

00:54:07.840 --> 00:54:08.739
In other words,

00:54:08.840 --> 00:54:10.739
what I want you to do is experiment

00:54:10.840 --> 00:54:12.739
and try different postures,

00:54:12.840 --> 00:54:13.739
different forms, different ways

00:54:13.840 --> 00:54:16.739
and start seeing what's connecting

00:54:16.840 --> 00:54:18.739
with you, what's working.

00:54:18.840 --> 00:54:20.739
Step three, when you begin,

00:54:20.840 --> 00:54:23.739
focus your mind and heart on God

00:54:23.840 --> 00:54:27.739
say or think, here I am, Lord.

00:54:27.840 --> 00:54:28.739
Here I am, Lord.

00:54:28.840 --> 00:54:29.739
This comes back to quality

00:54:29.840 --> 00:54:30.739
of your attention and presence.

00:54:30.840 --> 00:54:31.739
Right here at the beginning,

00:54:31.840 --> 00:54:34.739
you're setting your intention

00:54:34.840 --> 00:54:36.739
and your attention, right?

00:54:36.840 --> 00:54:37.739
Oh, that's right.

00:54:37.840 --> 00:54:41.739
God, you're real and you're present

00:54:41.840 --> 00:54:42.739
and you're there

00:54:42.840 --> 00:54:45.739
and that's why I'm here

00:54:45.840 --> 00:54:46.739
so that deep within me

00:54:46.840 --> 00:54:48.739
can call out to deep within you,

00:54:48.840 --> 00:54:49.739
God, and we can commune

00:54:49.840 --> 00:54:51.739
and connect, right?

00:54:51.840 --> 00:54:52.739
So it's just setting

00:54:52.739 --> 00:54:54.639
that intention.

00:54:54.739 --> 00:54:57.639
Step four, allow words, Matthew 6,

00:54:57.739 --> 00:55:00.639
to lead into silence, Romans 8,

00:55:00.739 --> 00:55:02.639
or vice versa.

00:55:02.739 --> 00:55:04.639
Again, the exact style of prayer

00:55:04.739 --> 00:55:06.639
less important than the quality

00:55:06.739 --> 00:55:08.639
of your presence and you will find

00:55:08.739 --> 00:55:11.639
one tends to lead into the other.

00:55:11.739 --> 00:55:13.639
For years, I always started

00:55:13.739 --> 00:55:15.639
with prayers for people

00:55:15.739 --> 00:55:17.639
and then I went into silence.

00:55:17.739 --> 00:55:19.639
Just recently, I've been reversing it

00:55:19.739 --> 00:55:20.639
partly because I find

00:55:20.639 --> 00:55:22.540
after a long time of silence,

00:55:22.639 --> 00:55:23.540
or sometimes not so long,

00:55:23.639 --> 00:55:26.540
but just some time of silence,

00:55:26.639 --> 00:55:27.540
the quality of my attention

00:55:27.639 --> 00:55:30.540
and presence is so different.

00:55:30.639 --> 00:55:32.540
You come in like crazy,

00:55:32.639 --> 00:55:33.540
especially if you pray in the evening

00:55:33.639 --> 00:55:34.540
and it's been a crazy day

00:55:34.639 --> 00:55:35.540
and you sit down and you're like,

00:55:35.639 --> 00:55:36.540
okay, let me just run through

00:55:36.639 --> 00:55:37.540
this list real quick,

00:55:37.639 --> 00:55:39.540
pray for these folks.

00:55:39.639 --> 00:55:41.540
You can see where it's just

00:55:41.639 --> 00:55:42.540
like another to-do.

00:55:42.639 --> 00:55:43.540
So there is something

00:55:43.639 --> 00:55:47.540
about taking some time to like,

00:55:47.639 --> 00:55:49.540
and then all of a sudden,

00:55:49.540 --> 00:55:51.439
your prayers for your own self,

00:55:51.540 --> 00:55:53.439
for others, like it's a,

00:55:53.540 --> 00:55:54.439
that's a different experience,

00:55:54.540 --> 00:55:56.439
but try different things,

00:55:56.540 --> 00:55:59.439
feel it out, whatever works for you.

00:55:59.540 --> 00:56:01.439
Step five, when you notice

00:56:01.540 --> 00:56:03.439
your mind wandering,

00:56:03.540 --> 00:56:05.439
gently return to God's presence.

00:56:05.540 --> 00:56:07.439
Key word there, being gently.

00:56:07.540 --> 00:56:09.439
People get very frustrated.

00:56:09.540 --> 00:56:11.439
Like I'm no good at prayer.

00:56:11.540 --> 00:56:13.439
My mind always wanders.

00:56:13.540 --> 00:56:15.439
Yeah, of course,

00:56:15.540 --> 00:56:16.439
because you're a human being

00:56:16.540 --> 00:56:18.439
and I think people feel like

00:56:18.540 --> 00:56:19.439
they're alone.

00:56:19.540 --> 00:56:20.439
These other people,

00:56:20.540 --> 00:56:21.439
they just are,

00:56:21.540 --> 00:56:22.439
their minds are like steel traps

00:56:22.540 --> 00:56:23.439
and they're just locked

00:56:23.540 --> 00:56:25.439
in the presence of the Lord.

00:56:25.540 --> 00:56:27.439
No, no, I mean,

00:56:27.540 --> 00:56:28.439
maybe the lady who was praying

00:56:28.540 --> 00:56:29.439
at that church I was talking about,

00:56:29.540 --> 00:56:30.439
she's done it for 20 years,

00:56:30.540 --> 00:56:32.439
she seemed real good at prayer,

00:56:32.540 --> 00:56:34.439
but for most of us mere mortals,

00:56:34.540 --> 00:56:36.439
like of course our minds wander.

00:56:36.540 --> 00:56:37.439
It's okay.

00:56:37.540 --> 00:56:40.439
The key is don't get judgy, right?

00:56:40.540 --> 00:56:41.439
Like, oh, I suck at this.

00:56:41.540 --> 00:56:44.439
No, just gently,

00:56:44.540 --> 00:56:48.439
just gently return to God's presence.

00:56:48.439 --> 00:56:51.340
Yeah, be easy on yourself.

00:56:51.439 --> 00:56:53.340
And then finally, step six,

00:56:53.439 --> 00:56:54.340
end your prayer time

00:56:54.439 --> 00:56:57.340
with gratitude and a smile.

00:56:57.439 --> 00:56:58.340
Even if you had to face

00:56:58.439 --> 00:57:00.340
some hard things.

00:57:00.439 --> 00:57:01.340
Even if, you know,

00:57:01.439 --> 00:57:04.340
face some of the feelings

00:57:04.439 --> 00:57:05.340
or maybe praying for situations

00:57:05.439 --> 00:57:09.340
that are really difficult.

00:57:09.439 --> 00:57:10.340
You want to be careful

00:57:10.439 --> 00:57:11.340
that prayer doesn't become

00:57:11.439 --> 00:57:13.340
just a slog.

00:57:13.439 --> 00:57:15.340
So end in this heart posture

00:57:15.439 --> 00:57:18.340
of gratitude.

00:57:18.439 --> 00:57:21.340
So my kind of heart

00:57:21.439 --> 00:57:23.340
is that this year,

00:57:23.439 --> 00:57:25.340
I hope more of us

00:57:25.439 --> 00:57:27.340
can learn to pray,

00:57:27.439 --> 00:57:28.340
learn to connect with God

00:57:28.439 --> 00:57:29.340
in that way.

00:57:29.439 --> 00:57:30.340
So we're going to transition

00:57:30.439 --> 00:57:32.340
to communion.

00:57:32.439 --> 00:57:34.340
And one of the beautiful things

00:57:34.439 --> 00:57:35.340
as you journey into prayer

00:57:35.439 --> 00:57:37.340
you'll learn is that

00:57:37.439 --> 00:57:39.340
even things that you don't

00:57:39.439 --> 00:57:42.340
classically think of as prayer

00:57:42.439 --> 00:57:44.340
can become prayer

00:57:44.439 --> 00:57:47.340
when you engage it

00:57:47.340 --> 00:57:49.239
in a certain mental mode.

00:57:49.340 --> 00:57:51.239
When you are fully

00:57:51.340 --> 00:57:53.239
showing up to that.

00:57:53.340 --> 00:57:54.239
Suddenly you're present

00:57:54.340 --> 00:57:55.239
to yourself

00:57:55.340 --> 00:57:56.239
and therefore you're present

00:57:56.340 --> 00:57:57.239
to God.

00:57:57.340 --> 00:57:59.239
And so kind of my hope

00:57:59.340 --> 00:58:00.239
as we come forward

00:58:00.340 --> 00:58:02.239
to partake of communion tonight,

00:58:02.340 --> 00:58:04.239
to take the body of Christ

00:58:04.340 --> 00:58:05.239
in the bread,

00:58:05.340 --> 00:58:06.239
and the blood of Christ

00:58:06.340 --> 00:58:07.239
in the wine,

00:58:07.340 --> 00:58:09.239
is that we could do it

00:58:09.340 --> 00:58:12.239
in a posture of prayer.

00:58:12.340 --> 00:58:13.239
And that we could go out

00:58:13.340 --> 00:58:15.239
from this place

00:58:15.239 --> 00:58:18.139
as people learning to pray.

00:58:18.239 --> 00:58:19.139
Not just when we're like

00:58:19.239 --> 00:58:20.139
literally hands folded

00:58:20.239 --> 00:58:22.139
having our prayer time,

00:58:22.239 --> 00:58:24.139
but in every moment.

00:58:24.239 --> 00:58:30.139
So the red is wine,

00:58:30.239 --> 00:58:32.139
the middle, white,

00:58:32.239 --> 00:58:34.139
is grape juice.

00:58:34.239 --> 00:58:35.139
I didn't mention it last time

00:58:35.239 --> 00:58:37.139
and some people were very confused.

00:58:37.239 --> 00:58:39.139
And someone almost, I heard,

00:58:39.239 --> 00:58:41.139
spit out their wine.

00:58:41.239 --> 00:58:45.139
So it wasn't eating.

00:58:45.239 --> 00:58:47.139
Don't worry.

00:58:47.239 --> 00:58:49.139
And so that's that.

00:58:49.239 --> 00:58:51.139
The bread is gluten free.

00:58:51.239 --> 00:58:52.139
We also practice

00:58:52.239 --> 00:58:53.139
what's called an open table.

00:58:53.239 --> 00:58:54.139
Meaning if you're here tonight

00:58:54.239 --> 00:58:55.139
and you want to participate,

00:58:55.239 --> 00:58:58.139
then you're free to do that.

00:58:58.239 --> 00:58:59.139
We're going to form

00:58:59.239 --> 00:59:00.139
kind of one line here

00:59:00.239 --> 00:59:01.139
and then as people serve,

00:59:01.239 --> 00:59:02.139
you'll be able

00:59:02.239 --> 00:59:03.139
to kind of branch off

00:59:03.239 --> 00:59:05.139
and go to whatever side

00:59:05.239 --> 00:59:07.139
you're seated on.

00:59:07.239 --> 00:59:09.139
So this is the table.

00:59:09.239 --> 00:59:10.139
Not of the church,

00:59:10.239 --> 00:59:11.139
but of the Lord.

00:59:11.239 --> 00:59:12.139
And it's made ready

00:59:12.239 --> 00:59:13.139
for those who love Him

00:59:13.239 --> 00:59:14.139
and for those who want

00:59:14.139 --> 00:59:15.040
to love Him more.

00:59:15.139 --> 00:59:16.040
So come.

00:59:16.139 --> 00:59:17.040
You who have much faith

00:59:17.139 --> 00:59:19.040
and you who have little.

00:59:19.139 --> 00:59:21.040
You who have been here often

00:59:21.139 --> 00:59:22.040
and you who have

00:59:22.139 --> 00:59:24.040
not been here long.

00:59:24.139 --> 00:59:26.040
You who have tried to follow

00:59:26.139 --> 00:59:31.040
and you who have failed.

00:59:31.139 --> 00:59:33.040
Come.

00:59:33.139 --> 00:59:35.040
Because it's the Lord Jesus Himself

00:59:35.139 --> 00:59:37.040
who invites you.

00:59:37.139 --> 00:59:38.040
And it's His will

00:59:38.139 --> 00:59:39.040
that those who want to meet Him

00:59:39.139 --> 00:59:42.040
should meet Him here.

00:59:42.040 --> 00:59:43.939
Table.

01:00:12.040 --> 01:00:21.939
♪♪

01:00:21.939 --> 01:00:41.840
♪♪

01:00:41.840 --> 01:01:01.739
♪♪

01:01:01.739 --> 01:01:31.639
♪♪

01:01:31.739 --> 01:02:01.639
♪♪

01:02:01.739 --> 01:02:31.639
♪♪

01:02:31.739 --> 01:03:01.639
♪♪

01:03:01.739 --> 01:03:31.639
♪♪

01:03:31.739 --> 01:03:41.639
♪♪

01:03:41.739 --> 01:03:43.639
For this last song,

01:03:43.739 --> 01:03:45.639
we're going to sing one

01:03:45.739 --> 01:03:47.639
that I just,

01:03:47.739 --> 01:03:48.639
I want to invite you

01:03:48.739 --> 01:03:49.639
to just sit back

01:03:49.739 --> 01:03:51.639
and practice a moment

01:03:51.739 --> 01:03:53.639
of being silent

01:03:53.739 --> 01:03:54.639
and maybe checking in

01:03:54.739 --> 01:03:57.639
with yourself,

01:03:57.739 --> 01:03:59.639
like Brett was talking about tonight.

01:03:59.639 --> 01:04:01.540
I love the idea of prayer

01:04:01.639 --> 01:04:04.540
as kind of returning home.

01:04:04.639 --> 01:04:06.540
And I feel like

01:04:06.639 --> 01:04:07.540
it's easy for me

01:04:07.639 --> 01:04:08.540
to approach prayer

01:04:08.639 --> 01:04:09.540
as like I need to get

01:04:09.639 --> 01:04:11.540
to a certain place.

01:04:11.639 --> 01:04:12.540
You know,

01:04:12.639 --> 01:04:13.540
like it's something

01:04:13.639 --> 01:04:15.540
outside of myself.

01:04:15.639 --> 01:04:17.540
As opposed to sitting

01:04:17.639 --> 01:04:19.540
and returning to

01:04:19.639 --> 01:04:21.540
the place where

01:04:21.639 --> 01:04:24.540
a Creator knit me together.

01:04:24.639 --> 01:04:28.540
I am fully who He made me to be.

01:04:28.540 --> 01:04:29.439
And I think in life,

01:04:29.540 --> 01:04:30.439
there's so many things

01:04:30.540 --> 01:04:32.439
that pull us away from that.

01:04:32.540 --> 01:04:34.439
And even our sins,

01:04:34.540 --> 01:04:36.439
our struggles,

01:04:36.540 --> 01:04:39.439
our judgments of ourself

01:04:39.540 --> 01:04:40.439
can take us down paths

01:04:40.540 --> 01:04:41.439
that are very far from

01:04:41.540 --> 01:04:43.439
the person we began as.

01:04:43.540 --> 01:04:46.439
And I would love for us

01:04:46.540 --> 01:04:48.439
to kind of engage this song

01:04:48.540 --> 01:04:49.439
as sort of a practice

01:04:49.540 --> 01:04:51.439
of returning home

01:04:51.540 --> 01:04:53.439
to that human

01:04:53.540 --> 01:04:56.439
that God knit together.

01:04:56.540 --> 01:04:57.439
So you guys,

01:04:57.439 --> 01:04:59.340
enjoy this as Gary leads it.

01:04:59.439 --> 01:05:01.340
It's one of my favorites.

01:05:01.340 --> 01:05:14.239
I went the ways of wayward winds

01:05:14.340 --> 01:05:16.239
In the world of trouble and sin

01:05:16.340 --> 01:05:19.239
Bought the law from a crooked mind

01:05:19.340 --> 01:05:22.239
Not a million rank and file

01:05:22.340 --> 01:05:24.239
Worked out where I came from

01:05:24.340 --> 01:05:27.239
Somewhere back when I was young

01:05:27.340 --> 01:05:31.239
I was a good man's child

01:05:31.340 --> 01:05:33.239
I lost the nameless things

01:05:33.340 --> 01:05:36.239
My innocence flew away from me

01:05:36.340 --> 01:05:39.239
She had had a face from my side

01:05:39.340 --> 01:05:42.239
To embrace her pit and fire

01:05:42.340 --> 01:05:44.239
But tonight I dream

01:05:44.340 --> 01:05:47.239
She's singing over me

01:05:47.340 --> 01:05:50.239
Oh Lord my child

01:05:50.340 --> 01:05:57.239
Come on home

01:05:58.239 --> 01:06:01.139
Hold to me

01:06:01.239 --> 01:06:07.139
And I will hold you in my arms

01:06:07.239 --> 01:06:10.139
Be joyful dear

01:06:10.239 --> 01:06:17.139
There will always

01:06:17.239 --> 01:06:22.139
Always be a place

01:06:22.239 --> 01:06:27.139
For you at the table

01:06:27.239 --> 01:06:41.139
Eternally

01:06:41.239 --> 01:06:51.139
Oh

01:06:51.239 --> 01:06:53.139
I wonder where I might begin

01:06:53.239 --> 01:06:55.139
To hear a voice upon the wind

01:06:55.239 --> 01:06:57.139
She's singing faith and singing

01:06:57.239 --> 01:06:58.139
The truth

01:06:58.239 --> 01:07:00.139
Son there ain't nothing you can do

01:07:00.239 --> 01:07:02.139
Listen close and follow me

01:07:02.239 --> 01:07:05.139
I'll take you where you're meant to be

01:07:05.239 --> 01:07:09.139
Just don't lose faith

01:07:09.239 --> 01:07:12.139
So I put my hand upon the plow

01:07:12.239 --> 01:07:14.139
And wiped the sweat from my brow

01:07:14.239 --> 01:07:17.139
And left a good seed along the way

01:07:17.239 --> 01:07:19.139
As I look forward to the day

01:07:19.239 --> 01:07:21.139
When at last I see

01:07:21.239 --> 01:07:24.139
My father wrote to me

01:07:24.239 --> 01:07:27.139
I'm singing oh my child

01:07:27.239 --> 01:07:34.139
Come on home

01:07:34.239 --> 01:07:37.139
Hold to me

01:07:37.239 --> 01:07:43.139
And I will hold you in my arms

01:07:43.239 --> 01:07:46.139
Be joyful dear

01:07:46.239 --> 01:07:53.139
There will always

01:07:53.239 --> 01:07:57.139
Always be a place

01:07:57.239 --> 01:08:02.139
For you at the table

01:08:02.239 --> 01:08:14.139
Return to me my child

01:08:14.239 --> 01:08:24.140
Come on home

01:08:24.140 --> 01:08:31.040
Come on home

01:08:31.140 --> 01:08:34.040
Hold to me

01:08:34.140 --> 01:08:40.040
And I will hold you in my arms

01:08:40.140 --> 01:08:43.040
Be joyful dear

01:08:43.140 --> 01:08:50.040
There will always

01:08:50.140 --> 01:08:54.040
Always be a place

01:08:54.140 --> 01:08:59.040
For you at my table

01:08:59.140 --> 01:09:04.040
At my table

01:09:04.140 --> 01:09:09.040
At my table

01:09:09.140 --> 01:09:23.040
Return to me

01:09:23.040 --> 01:09:24.939
Thank you guys so much.

01:09:25.040 --> 01:09:26.939
And again, thank you for choosing

01:09:27.040 --> 01:09:29.939
to spend this evening here with us

01:09:30.040 --> 01:09:31.939
together in the presence of a God

01:09:32.040 --> 01:09:33.939
who loves you and knows you

01:09:34.040 --> 01:09:35.939
and calls you by name.

01:09:36.040 --> 01:09:37.939
The lovely people who are serving

01:09:38.040 --> 01:09:39.939
communion tonight, Christian and Megan,

01:09:40.040 --> 01:09:42.939
are the ones who have a new meetup group.

01:09:43.040 --> 01:09:44.939
So if you want to touch base with them

01:09:45.040 --> 01:09:46.939
after the service, definitely go up

01:09:47.040 --> 01:09:47.939
and let them know.

01:09:48.040 --> 01:09:49.939
And again, that's for 20-somethings

01:09:50.040 --> 01:09:51.939
or fresh out of high school

01:09:51.939 --> 01:09:52.839
or college.

01:09:52.939 --> 01:09:55.839
Not really a tight, like, restraint on that,

01:09:55.939 --> 01:09:56.839
but definitely reach out to them

01:09:56.939 --> 01:09:58.839
or someone else if you are interested.

01:09:58.939 --> 01:10:01.839
Also, as you are walking out,

01:10:01.939 --> 01:10:03.839
to your right is our giving box,

01:10:03.939 --> 01:10:05.839
but there's also a form to fill out.

01:10:05.939 --> 01:10:06.839
If you call the table home

01:10:06.939 --> 01:10:08.839
and you would like to plug in

01:10:08.939 --> 01:10:09.839
with serving communion

01:10:09.939 --> 01:10:12.839
or children's ministry or whatever,

01:10:12.939 --> 01:10:13.839
fill out that form

01:10:13.939 --> 01:10:15.839
because we would love to plug you in

01:10:15.939 --> 01:10:18.839
and get to know you more through that.

01:10:18.939 --> 01:10:21.839
And again, February 12th,

01:10:21.939 --> 01:10:23.839
Bible Sunday.

01:10:23.939 --> 01:10:26.839
We will be meeting at 4, not 5.

01:10:26.939 --> 01:10:27.839
Go, teams.

01:10:27.939 --> 01:10:36.839
And in the same vein as different ways

01:10:36.939 --> 01:10:39.839
to pray and acknowledge God

01:10:39.939 --> 01:10:43.839
and God's presence and love and goodness,

01:10:43.939 --> 01:10:46.839
my meetup group, we meet online,

01:10:46.939 --> 01:10:48.839
and we all live in different places.

01:10:48.939 --> 01:10:51.839
And so when someone's going through a hard time,

01:10:51.939 --> 01:10:53.839
everyone will send pictures of candles

01:10:53.939 --> 01:10:54.839
that have been lit

01:10:54.939 --> 01:10:55.839
and just in honor of,

01:10:55.939 --> 01:10:56.839
I'm praying for you,

01:10:56.939 --> 01:10:57.839
and I've lit this candle.

01:10:57.939 --> 01:10:59.839
And so, thanks, Stephanie.

01:10:59.939 --> 01:11:00.839
She's smiling.

01:11:00.939 --> 01:11:01.839
She's here in person tonight.

01:11:01.939 --> 01:11:03.839
That's exciting.

01:11:03.939 --> 01:11:04.839
But she's the one who always does that.

01:11:04.939 --> 01:11:05.839
And so tonight,

01:11:05.939 --> 01:11:09.839
as we're thinking about the victims in California

01:11:09.939 --> 01:11:11.839
and so many mass shootings,

01:11:11.939 --> 01:11:13.839
there's already been 30 this year.

01:11:13.939 --> 01:11:15.839
That's more than one a day.

01:11:15.939 --> 01:11:17.839
And it's just tragic.

01:11:17.839 --> 01:11:21.740
So as I come over to blow out this candle,

01:11:21.839 --> 01:11:24.740
if we can take another just collective moment

01:11:24.839 --> 01:11:28.740
of silence, deep breath in of love,

01:11:28.839 --> 01:11:31.740
exhaling hate and fear,

